Variables

SN  // 100 x 2 circular buffer array with 100 X,Y positions for the snake body
SH  // SNAKE HEAD INDEX
ST  // SNAKE TAIL INDEX
SZ  // SNAKE SIZE
DX  // MOVE X DIRECTION
DY  // MOVE Y DIRECTION
FX% // FOOD X POSITION
FY% // FOOD Y POSITION
LV  // LEVEL
DE  // MOVEMENT DELAY
PI  // SOUND PITCH DURATION
SC  // SCORE
HS  // HISCORE
MV  // WALL BRICK TO MOVE NEXT
M2  // 2ND WALL BRICK TO MOVE NEXT
GW  // GROW SNAKE FLAG
IN  // HI SCORE INTERMISSION FLAG

Subroutines by line number

GAME SETUP          10
GAME LOOP          500
RENDER SNAKE      1000
ADD FOOD          1500
READ KEYBOARD     2000
MINE DISTANCE     2500
PROCESS MOVE      3000
READ HISCORES     3500
PLAY SOUND        4000
TITLE COBRAS      4100
TITLE BYNELBR     4200
RERENDER SNAKE    4300
LEVEL ANIMATION   4400
TITLE LEVEL       4500
TITLE UP!         4600
HISCORE ANIMATION 4700
RENDER MINES      4800
R. MORE MINES     4900
TITLE GAME        5500
TITLE OVER        5700
SAVE HI SCORE     5800
END GAME          6000

Music Player
$1E and $1F are now managed by the program

SongPtrLo - $7022 (28706) should contain $CA = 202
SongPtrHi - $7023 (28707) should contain $72 = 114

SongValue - $72CC


