190 CALL BA
200 POKE 28706,152 : POKE 28707,114
210 CALL BA + 3
220 POKE 49168,0
225 KY = PEEK (49152)
230 IF KY > 128 GOTO 250
240 CALL BA+9 : FOR X=1 TO 3 : NEXT : GOTO 225
250 CALL BA+6 : POKE 49168,0
