5000 REM DRAW HI SCORE
5010 VLIN Y,Y+6 AT X: VLIN Y,Y+6 AT X+4 : HLIN X,X+4 AT Y+3
5020 X = X + 6 : VLIN Y, Y+6 AT X 
5030 X = X + 2 : HLIN X+1,X+4 AT Y : HLIN X+1,X+3 AT Y+3 : HLIN X,X+3 AT Y+6 : VLIN Y+1,Y+2 AT X : VLIN Y+4,Y+5 AT X+4
5040 X = X + 6 : HLIN X+1,X+4 AT Y : HLIN X+1,X+4 AT Y+6 : VLIN Y+1,Y+5 AT X
5050 X = X + 6 : HLIN X+1,X+3 AT Y : HLIN X+1,X+3 AT Y+6 : VLIN Y+1,Y+5 AT X   : VLIN Y+1,Y+5 AT X+4
5060 X = X + 6 : VLIN Y,Y+6 AT X   : HLIN X+1,X+3 AT Y   : HLIN X+1,X+3 AT Y+3 : VLIN Y+1,Y+2 AT X+4 : HLIN X+2,X+4 AT Y+4 : VLIN Y+5,Y+6 AT X+4
5070 X = X + 6 : VLIN Y,Y+6 AT X : HLIN X,X+4 AT Y : HLIN X,X+3 AT Y+3 : HLIN X,X+4 AT Y+6
